      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-09-12_WidnesExaminer_art0120" n="art0120">
        <head>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>RESULTS OF SATURDAY'S MATCHES. THE NORTHERN RUBY LEAGUE.</p>
